  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "If you ask him, he will kill the person who killed you. Such is the rumor of the Grim Reaper that circulates among the dead. Tomoko Mitani, who was killed by her unfaithful lover, believes the rumor and visits the Grim Reaper. However, the Grim Reaper is not a \"friend of justice\". Moreover, there is a big lie about the cause of her death. ...... Gradually, the hatred, sorrow, and truth of the dead are revealed. Will there be salvation beyond that?"
  },
